1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Windowfolk: a little civilization between your windows.
A native macOS application, built from Kiro specifications.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:14,000
Chinese menu: Debug > Trigger wish > Deliver flowers.
Dudu is the silver cat; Doodoo is the golden hamster.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Drag a plank from the toolbox to connect two real windows.
The residents use the window tops as roads.

4
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Move a supporting window while the resident is crossing.
The broken route causes hanging, falling, and landing.

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:43,000
Place a ladder to restore a route from the floor.
The resident climbs and can continue the flower delivery.

6
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The flower is planted for the neighbor.
Chinese menu: Debug > Fast-forward advances flower growth.

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:01:01,566
The flower sprouts and blooms.
The neighbor returns a piece of fruit.

8
00:01:01,566 --> 00:01:12,000
Chinese menu: Debug > Trigger wish > Chair.
Place the unlocked chair on a window ledge.

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Chinese menu: Debug > Trigger wish > Lamp.
Day/night > Night enables sleeping beside the lamp.

10
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:34,300
Day/night > Day demonstrates waking.
Furniture can be moved or returned to the toolbox.

11
00:01:34,300 --> 00:01:44,000
Chinese menu: Debug > Trigger wish > Visit another window.
A flag marks the resident's destination.

12
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:54,300
Connect a route to the flag. TextEdit's note reads:
“Windowfolk. Welcome to visit the new window.”

13
00:01:54,300 --> 00:02:09,800
Chinese menu: Debug > Trigger wish > Play chase.
Dudu catches Doodoo in this chase.

14
00:02:09,800 --> 00:02:17,800
Changing the window layout can break the chase route.
This time, Doodoo escapes.

15
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:25,800
Both a catch and an escape complete the chase wish.
The residents keep a memory of what happened.

16
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:32,800
Diary > Write today's diary. Dudu and Doodoo record their events.
Full diary translations: the English translations link in the description.

17
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:36,800
Settings: LLM service, endpoint, model name, API key.
Use LLM for diaries / Resident thoughts: both off.

18
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:48,800
Chinese menu: Quit saves the world.
Reopening restores the residents, objects, and unlocks.

19
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:54,800
Old-school desktop magic, reimagined.
Download, source, and English testing instructions are linked below.
